- **Layer 3 — warn-first:** missing `Qty/mL` on Injectable, unparseable MDD, footnote mark without a matching definition, q.s. rows → warn + placeholder, never abort.
- **Critical anchors:** the FILLED sheet type is the **authoritative unit basis** — stop inferring mg/mL vs mg/unit downstream (removes the T5/T7.1 volume-basis class of bugs). Footnote marks are **declared** here → `*`→salt_factor/base-equivalence (this row only), `@`→process-removed, `q.s.`→calc-exempt; bind per-row via `NoteIndex`, no global scan. Sheet-type detection and column mapping MUST be fuzzy/tolerant.

